# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Qiskit Addons](https://github.com/Qiskit?q=qiskit-addon) are official extension packages that provide specialized quantum computing algorithms and techniques.\n"
msgstr "[Qiskit Addons](https://github.com/Qiskit?q=qiskit-addon) son paquetes de extensión oficiales que proporcionan algoritmos y técnicas especializadas de computación cuántica.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tutorials here {#tutorials-here}"
msgstr "Tutoriales disponibles aquí {#tutorials-here}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Addon | Package | Description |\n"
"|-------|---------|-------------|\n"
"| **Circuit Cutting** | `qiskit-addon-cutting` | Reduce circuit width by cutting gates, and find cuts automatically |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Addon | Paquete | Descripción |\n"
"|-------|---------|-------------|\n"
"| **Circuit Cutting** | `qiskit-addon-cutting` | Reduce el ancho del circuito cortando puertas y encuentra los cortes automáticamente |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum's documentation no longer has guides for this addon, and no IBM tutorial covers these two. They come from the addon's GitHub repository and may be outdated. They can be executed directly in your browser using Binder, or on your own Jupyter server.\n"
msgstr "La documentación de IBM Quantum ya no incluye guías para este addon, y ningún tutorial de IBM cubre estos dos. Provienen del repositorio de GitHub del addon y pueden estar desactualizados. Se pueden ejecutar directamente en tu navegador con Binder, o en tu propio servidor de Jupyter.\n"

